            "challenge_claim": "AGoQ combines layer-aware activation quantization and precision-preserved gradient quantization within Megatron-LM-style distributed training (Section 3).",
            "challenge_claim_sha256": "0b198b87a5abf16409a547a6f5277a41a62eac4a791b71cada94b054c65a1a13",
