            "challenge_claim": "Layer-aware activation quantization reduces cached activation memory for a transformer layer from 28U in BF16 and 16.5U in COAT to 7.75U (Table 1).",
            "challenge_claim_sha256": "89292ed940125355f402bc04bc847acbed65f01bd0718124cceb88416ec24228",
            "target_claim": "Layer-aware activation quantization reduces cached activation memory for a transformer layer from 28U in BF16 and 16.5U in COAT to 7.75U (Table 1)."
          },
          {
            "challenge_claim": "Dynamic Bit-width Compensation for Pipeline Parallelism assigns higher activation bit-widths to underutilized pipeline stages while maintaining near-4-bit activation storage (Section 4.2).",
